= A Mother's Freedom

Among the thousands freed when the abolition orders reach Tatooine is a woman named Shmi Skywalker, a moisture farmer's wife who was once a slave in Mos Espa. Judicial officers bring her to Coruscant.

When the Temple tells young Anakin, he goes to meet her ship alone. For an afternoon, the Chosen One is only a son.
